1
00:00:04,199 --> 00:00:04,750
Your soulmate

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,950
is at the end

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:06,850
of this thread.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:07,750
Follow it today…

5
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:08,949
and you'll meet them

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:09,250
tonight.

7
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,149
But you'd skip

8
00:00:10,199 --> 00:00:11,049
every wrong turn.

9
00:00:11,099 --> 00:00:11,649
Every almost.

10
00:00:11,699 --> 00:00:12,250
Every story

11
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,149
on the way.

12
00:00:13,199 --> 00:00:14,049
Maybe those detours

13
00:00:14,099 --> 00:00:15,249
are what make you

14
00:00:15,299 --> 00:00:15,549
ready.

15
00:00:15,599 --> 00:00:16,870
Or maybe waiting

16
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:22,890
is just time

17
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,589
you never get back.

18
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:28,370
So…

19
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,080
would you follow it?

